---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="AutoDeck · Complete car care. All under one roof."
  description="Detailing, paint protection, ceramic, washing, garage and modification at one address in Ellisbridge, Ahmedabad, with your car's whole record in the app you hold. Grand opening Friday 16 October 2026."
  page="home"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow rv">Ellisbridge · Ahmedabad</p>
        <h1 class="rv">Complete car care. All under <em>one roof.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede rv">Every finish, every fix, every wash, by one team. And an app that keeps the whole story of your car.</p>
        <div class="actions rv">
          <a class="btn" href="https://app.autodeck.in">Book a slot <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="tel:+919898679711">Call the studio</a>
        </div>
        <p class="fine rv">Published prices. Photos at every stage. Doors open Friday 16 October, 10 am.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="frame rv" style="margin:0">
        <img src="/assets/img/studio-orange.jpg" alt="The AutoDeck studio: polished floor, track lighting and a car on the lift" width="896" height="1195" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="live" aria-live="off">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <div><small>Live job card</small><b id="live-line">Vehicle received</b><em id="live-time">09:12 am</em></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="cap">
          <span><b>Doors open in</b>Studio design render</span>
          <span class="count" id="countdown" data-target="2026-10-16T10:00:00+05:30" role="status">
            <span><b data-cd="d">00</b><i>days</i></span><span><b data-cd="h">00</b><i>hrs</i></span><span><b data-cd="m">00</b><i>min</i></span>
            <span style="display:none"><b data-cd="s">00</b></span>
          </span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="trust">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="rv"><b>Prices published first</b><span>You know the cost before the car comes in.</span></div>
      <div class="rv"><b>Photos at every stage</b><span>Watch the work from your phone as it happens.</span></div>
      <div class="rv"><b>Warranty on record</b><span>Papers and history kept in the app, ready when you sell.</span></div>
      <div class="rv"><b>Nothing outsourced</b><span>One team, one standard, under one roof.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="s-head rv">
        <p class="eyebrow">Six crafts</p>
        <h2>Everything your car needs, done properly.</h2>
        <p>Protect it, perfect it, keep it clean, keep it running. One address instead of six.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid3">
        <a class="card rv" href="/services" style="text-decoration:none"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Paint Protection Film</h3><p>Self-healing film cut to your car. From ₹22,000 for a front-end kit.</p><span class="z">Detailing Lab</span></a>
        <a class="card rv" href="/services" style="text-decoration:none"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Ceramic Coating</h3><p>Five years of gloss, on record, with a 6-monthly check.</p><span class="z">Detailing Lab</span></a>
        <a class="card rv" href="/services" style="text-decoration:none"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Detailing</h3><p>Paint corrected under studio light, then measured.</p><span class="z">Detailing Lab</span></a>
        <a class="card rv" href="/services" style="text-decoration:none"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Washing</h3><p>Foam, two buckets, clean mitts. The wash it should always have been.</p><span class="z">Wash Studio</span></a>
        <a class="card rv" href="/services" style="text-decoration:none"><span class="n">05</span><h3>Garage</h3><p>Repairs and service, with a live job card you can watch.</p><span class="z">Performance Garage</span></a>
        <a class="card rv" href="/services" style="text-decoration:none"><span class="n">06</span><h3>Modification</h3><p>Upgrades chosen with care, fitted right the first time.</p><span class="z">Accessory Lounge</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="more rv"><a class="link" href="/services">See all services and prices</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s split" style="background:var(--ivory)">
    <div class="wrap">
      <figure class="frame rv" style="margin:0">
        <img src="/assets/img/car-lights.jpg" alt="A car under the linear lights of the AutoDeck Detailing Lab" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="cap"><span><b>Detailing Lab</b>Studio design render</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow rv">The record follows the car</p>
        <h2 class="rv" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,48px);margin-top:16px">Your car has been handed around enough.</h2>
        <p class="lede rv" style="margin-top:18px">Here one team perfects it, protects it and keeps its story. Nothing outsourced, every hand on your car is ours. Every photo, every warranty, every promise, in your hand.</p>
        <ul class="points">
          <li class="rv"><span class="k">01</span><div><b>Watch the work</b><span>Photos at every stage, as it happens.</span></div></li>
          <li class="rv"><span class="k">02</span><div><b>Prove it years later</b><span>Warranty, history and papers, ready the day you sell.</span></div></li>
          <li class="rv"><span class="k">03</span><div><b>Never miss a date</b><span>Reminders that arrive before the due date does.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="actions rv"><a class="btn" href="https://app.autodeck.in">Open the app</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/app">How it works</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s rooms">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="s-head rv">
        <p class="eyebrow">Four zones, one address</p>
        <h2>The studio, in four rooms.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="room-list">
        <div class="rv"><h3>Performance Garage</h3><p>Repairs, service and fitting.</p></div>
        <div class="rv"><h3>Detailing Lab</h3><p>Film, ceramic and paint correction.</p></div>
        <div class="rv"><h3>Wash Studio</h3><p>The careful wash, every time.</p></div>
        <div class="rv"><h3>Accessory Lounge</h3><p>Merch and care essentials.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s cta" style="padding-top:104px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-box rv">
        <div>
          <h2>Book your first slot.</h2>
          <p>Pick a service, see the price, choose a time. Doors open Friday 16 October, 10 am.</p>
          <div class="actions" style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn dark" href="https://app.autodeck.in">Book a slot <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="tel:+919898679711">+91 98986 79711</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="facts">
          <div><b>Find us</b>Sunbeam Complex, Old Sharda Mandir Rd, Ellisbridge</div>
          <div><b>Hours</b>Mon to Sat 10 am to 9 pm · Sun 10 am to 7 pm</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
